; RUN: dgtl-opt --pass=predication --filecheck %s
; FileCheck test for Control Predication pass with cross-platform EOL normalization
;
; This test ensures that the FileCheck directive matching works identically
; on Windows (\r\n line endings) and Unix (\n line endings) systems.
; The tool normalizes all line endings before directive matching.

op 0x0A 0x00000001 0x00000000 0x00000000 0x00000000 0x0000
op 0x53 0x00000002 0x00000001 0x00000000 0x00000000 0x0004

; CHECK: DGTL IR Text Format
; CHECK: Stream size: 2 nodes
; CHECK: op 0x0a 0x00000001
; CHECK: op 0x53 0x00000002
; CHECK-NOT: FAILED
; CHECK: End of IR
